    - rid: 3046479087689794346
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...Do you think that narrows it down at all? I haven''t left
          my room ever since I arrived, so I don''t know where people are. much less
          <b>who</b> they are.

          It seems very risky of you to just knock
          on random doors not knowing who lies beyond them, though. I''d advise you
          stop doing that... <b>if you know what''s good for you</b>...'
        characterEmotion: 0
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
