    - rid: 3046479087689794354
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...yeah, sure. And I suppose you''re now expecting me to "be
          cooperative" so that you may "protect me" from a "menace".

          Pro
          tip, kid: if you''re going to try and spy a major figure, make sure not
          to use the oldest trick from the book first.

          Do yourself a favour
          and get out of my sight.'
        characterEmotion: 3
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
